      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ رَهْمَآءُ</span></b>  <i>Land upon which rains such as are
termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِهَام</span> <i>have fallen:</i> (Ham p. 99:) and
